Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚出道的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I came over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那夹子是我用所有的钱 买的第一件东西 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that clip was the first thing I ever bought with my own money, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你要保管好 照看好它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you take care of it. You look after it.
