Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边去 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse us, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银行那事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}its important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我让我的人去处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I want to handle it my way, with my guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 维尼把比分告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Vinnie brought me this score.
