Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫兰德先生 我知道网络不是您的摇钱树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Weyland, I know that the network isn't your prime moneymaker.
