Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但又欲罢不能的电视节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and most watched programme in human history.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎大家收看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Death Match.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们第一位参赛者 被判四次终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our first fighter a murderer serving four consecutive life sentences,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:22.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山德·格雷迪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander Grady!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山德身负11条人命 终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander 11 kills, one submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6尺4寸，220磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6'4" 220 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的对手是"死亡终结3人组"的老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His opponent leader of the Terminal Island Triads,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前位于排行榜第二名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he currently ranks second on the kill board
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当年是国际刑警租狙击榜上头三甲 直到去年才在洛杉矶落入法网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was Interpol's third most wanted until his arrest in Los Angeles last year:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,14K 身负14条人命 终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14K one submission, 14 kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5尺11寸，159磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5'11" 159 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每周的比赛人选通过抽签产生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The combatants are picked by lottery randomly each week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赢有两种方式 杀了他 或者逼他就范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two ways to win. Kill your opponent or make him submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面的感压阀 一旦被激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are several pressure plates that, when activated
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与赛者便可有机会得到各种武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can give a fighter access to a variety of weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.41,0:22:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但武器必须要在10秒内获得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they only have 10 seconds to access them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没人胜出 那么庄家通杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If no fighter has won, both fighters are killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位观众 好戏即将登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dim the lights. The carnage is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是第一美姐儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.55,0:22:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一美姐儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟 宝贝 你就是我们的第一美姐嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, baby, you're my number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么个情况?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.43,0:23:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.53,0:24:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就那么想死吗?哼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.37,0:24:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧 伙计!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不会投降的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.35,0:24:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他降了! 才不是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He quit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.06,0:24:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是一次降!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another fucking submission!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.89,0:24:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他投降了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.87,0:24:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《你死我活》是维兰德国际娱乐旗下的一档栏目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Match is a trademark of Weyland International.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.08,0:25:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与赛者全是亡命之徒 警告观众请勿模仿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighters are convicted violent felons. Acts should not be duplicated at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.92,0:25:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道自己在做什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what the fuck do you think you are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.60,0:25:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死定了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.61,0:25:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关灯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 甜心儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.63,0:25:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚的数据进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The numbers from the overnights are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.55,0:26:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我请你来不是吃干饭的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I pay you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.93,0:26:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收视率又跌了 这次只有两成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ratings are down again. This time, 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最后能挽救颓势 否则我就另请高明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you better reverse the trend, or I'll End someone who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.31,0:26:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我确定 你现在拿着我的钱 懂了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm sure. Now, you make my motherfucking money. You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.63,0:26:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"死亡三人组"很铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a strict Triad code.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.92,0:26:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论是谁惹了他们 那他就泥菩萨过江 自身难保了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever spills the blood of a Triad, they're sworn to take that person's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.13,0:26:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山德在上次比赛中杀了其中之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander killed a Triad last match.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.93,0:26:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这就有点不符合常理 刚才那么好的机会 他却没有抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It defies logic why he wouldn't kill him if he had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.68,0:26:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 小子 我可不是来找朋友来了 懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid, I'm not looking for a best friend, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.93,0:26:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说 请别烦我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢卡斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,淡定 淡定 伙计 放松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chill. Chill, man. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被分到我们工作组了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been assigned to our work detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:24.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是拉库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Rocco,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.39,0:27:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫 金伯格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.77,0:27:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金伯格 哈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goldberg, huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 莫非你就是传说中... 那最后一个墨西哥犹太人 还是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, like, then. You, like, the last Mexican Jew, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.27,0:27:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我把其他人都宰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I killed all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.28,0:27:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 说到工作 我们负责什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So, this work detail, what are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.74,0:27:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉我咱们是洗内裤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't tell me we're washing underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.03,0:27:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管你喜欢做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't care what you're into.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是盥洗工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not washing anybody's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.16,0:27:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来 卢卡斯 华登找你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your fest, Lucas. Warden wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没你们的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢卡斯 20年内 被捕22次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas, arrested 22 times over a span of 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是没有什么大过 一个也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But nothing ever stuck, not a single damn one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是能逢凶化吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just slipped through the cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.67,0:28:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额 这次我杀了条子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I shot a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.84,0:28:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是人无千日好 花无百日红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those cracks, they till up pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.26,0:28:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这么个理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sure do. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起初我没有意识到你到底是何方神圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, at first I didn't realise who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗? 那现在呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? So, who am I'?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额 白痴一个 很快就入土了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, an idiot, and soon a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警让你出庭作证 你把他们拒了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DA offers you a talk and walk, and you tum him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.23,0:28:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为这事让我来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you gut me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.98,0:29:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不全是 我是想警告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, ifs not. I'm here to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省省吧 别自以为是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your breath. Oh, don't get smart with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道别人是怎么听说你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how many others know who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有口风放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when the word gets out,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有杀手要取你小命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the killers are gonna be coming out of the woodwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.41,0:29:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是这事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.41,0:29:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And mark my words,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马库斯·凯恩不会像你待他 那样待你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Markus Kane will not show you the same type of loyalty that you've shown him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 如果14K杀了山德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, 14K kills Xander,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会被认为是殉道者 十分风光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he makes him a martyr. Thais like an honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.23,0:29:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是投降 则意味着他们几个蒙受了奇耻大辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander quits, shames himself and the entire brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.75,0:29:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让别人觉得他是胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes him like a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.07,0:29:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们带他来了 伙计们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got him, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.20,0:29:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.33,0:29:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个问题 鼓捣这些个汽车 应该不是咱们该干的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a question. All these cars, man, it's not exactly prison norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.47,0:29:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么一档子事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:30:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 "死亡岛"才不是什么感化院 很明显吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Terminal Island is not about rehabilitation. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.09,0:30:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实早就产业化了 这些汽车 我们熔化了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a business. All these cars, we melt them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后用于生产枪支 弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make weapons, guns, shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:10.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制造一切可以用来杀人的玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it kills, we make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.35,0:30:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 你是说... 政府资助的钱 全用来回收破烂了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are you telling me the governments paying top dollar for this recycled shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府投资? 哪个说政府投资了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top dollar? Who said anything about top dollar?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.02,0:30:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维兰德国际把这些东西都贱卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland International sells this stuff dirt cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.94,0:30:22.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 咱们又不用付钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, when you're not paying for labour,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.36,0:30:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样价钱当然就很低了 知道怎么一回事了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your prices can afford to be a little lower, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在榨我们的血!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're making money off our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对车懂吗? 一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about these wheels? A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.16,0:30:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它状况怎么样? 自己体验下吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does she run? Why don't you see what she's got?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.75,0:30:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当真? 当真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For real?? For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.75,0:30:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何乐不为呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.03,0:31:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人要开车越语咯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's been driving a getaway car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.37,0:32:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天啊你还真有两把刷子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn, you put some magic in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.54,0:32:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它状况如何? 应该没什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does she handle? Just the way she's supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.46,0:32:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁刚才开车来着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was driving that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.67,0:32:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What car? What car?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.64,0:32:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 卢克 你也要参赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Luke, you a fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.89,0:32:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要参赛啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got no reason to fight anyone.
