Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.90,0:32:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡琳达正准备"提拔"新人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Calendar's always looking for new blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.61,0:32:31.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真符合她的口味儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you look like just her type.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼才知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你点儿忠告 低调 别给她任何机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some advice, blend in. Don't give her no reason to fixate on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.37,0:32:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 金伯格 我打死也不会去趟那浑水的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Goldberg, I'm the last guy looking for a fucking spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后! 退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:32:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody else stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.35,0:33:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都不要过来 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you in there. Move back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们全部的人 都退后! 快! 退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you, stay back! Let's go! Move back!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.95,0:33:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况? 大个自己摔了一跤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here? Big guy tripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.58,0:33:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这么一回事 比尔? 嗯 我自己摔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thai so, Bill? Yeah, I tripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没说错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.96,0:33:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 继续 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go! Keep it moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.38,0:33:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走! 动! 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move! Get moving! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.09,0:33:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小家伙是谁啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the little guy'?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他叫"百事通" - "百事通"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His name's "Lists". - "Lists"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.10,0:33:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.89,0:33:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你连电脑都没有听过? 看来你已经out几千年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever hear of a computer? You're, like, a century behind everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.48,0:33:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我也奇怪为什么没有算盘...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised I don't find an abacus in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.48,0:33:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有何贵干啊? 我来找他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing in my office? I'm here for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢卡斯 光听名字就够给力的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas. Even the name gives me a hard on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:34:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连法官都称他为"怪兽" 他太完美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The judge called him a monster at his trial. He's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.73,0:34:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以用他 没有那事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can sell him. You can't have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.50,0:34:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是来征求你同意的 等下 我还要交代下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't asking your permission. Wait. There's more to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.70,0:34:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警觉得这是一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DA thinks there's a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让他出面指证马库斯·凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he could turn state witness against Markus Kane.
