Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说那些人兽不如的家伙会宰了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not only could those animals kill him,
