Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有《你死我活》这档节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to facilitate Death Match.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.94,0:34:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我觉得咱们应该是 惩罚罪犯以保护咱们的社会秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here I thought we were here to protect society and punish criminals.
