Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.54,0:36:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会再让别人取代我的位子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you need another guy to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.75,0:36:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得 这有点...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that's...
