Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.84,0:47:27.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召集开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calla meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.93,0:47:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都叫谁来? 所有人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With who? Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.93,0:47:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛不回我电话啊? 很多人的电话我都不回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't return my calls. I don't return a lot of calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.02,0:47:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讨论下《你死我活》 是时候重新启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna discuss Death Match. I think that we should pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.72,0:47:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为这是闹着玩呢? 说重启就重启?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When a real life not doesn't generate a second hour boost,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.86,0:47:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说咱们还是开源节流吧 没错 我们是改改进了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say it's time to cut your loss. Exactly. We need to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.73,0:47:50.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得巩固我们的战果 而且我们也有豪华的主持阵容...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've developed a strong base, we have legitimate TV stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.10,0:47:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琼斯小姐 董事会的决定谁也改不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The board's decision is final, Miss Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.99,0:47:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的半年里 只有我在为公司盈利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the past six months, I'm the only profitable thing about this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.82,0:48:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你想我告你性骚扰 让你官司缠身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you want a sexual harassment suit crammed down your throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.08,0:48:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你才能听进我说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.06,0:48:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.56,0:48:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明早9点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9:00 a.m. tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.55,0:48:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.21,0:48:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本十分简单的任务 完成起来却依然曲曲折折\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What seemed to be a very simple task has taken the most perplexing of turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.22,0:48:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这次我要讲得清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm gonna speak slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.43,0:49:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢悠悠地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}clearly,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.89,0:49:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省得你们漏听 或者误解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so my message is not lost, or ignored, or misinterpreted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.02,0:49:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁杀了卡尔·卢卡斯 100万美刀就是谁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One million dollars to the man who kills Carl Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.20,0:49:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,48小时之后完不成的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This offer expires in 48 hours, and if that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.58,0:49:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把你们当作敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will consider you all enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.91,0:49:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候等着自己的脑袋搬家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will bring war on your fucking head.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.76,0:49:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡岛上我们投资的9成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninety percent of Terminal Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.34,0:49:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是无利润回报的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your grand investment, is dead space.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.68,0:49:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有《你死我活》让你们苟延残喘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Match merely stayed your execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.97,0:49:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们想要高枕无忧 就要有不做不休的精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wanna get a breath of fresh air, you need a bold initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.51,0:49:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我提议搞场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I propose 3 race.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.89,0:49:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能流芳百世 但求遗臭万年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wicked. Epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.90,0:49:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是前无古人后无来者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like no one has ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛用轨道环绕整个死亡岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The track will run the length of Terminal Island
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.49,0:49:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中各种曲折就不用我多说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along some of the narrowest and most harrowing paths
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.86,0:49:58.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更是赛车界中少见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the racing world has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.78,0:50:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更给力的则是 我们所需要的一切 都在自己后院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best part of it, everything that we need is right in our own backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.25,0:50:04.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车辆我们自己来改装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna modify each vehicle,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.08,0:50:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加装上装甲挡板 防弹玻璃 以及防滚笼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}adding reinforced steel plating, bulletproof glass, and roll cages
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.71,0:50:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让车手们有机会以一决高低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to at least give the drivers a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.92,0:50:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不惜一切让其噱头十足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take everything that made Death Match a hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.17,0:50:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将我们手头的一切资源整合于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}combine it with everything we have at our disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.09,0:50:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such as?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.22,0:50:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各种重型武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy fucking artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.89,0:50:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每辆车上都尽量配置上最多的武器弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every car will hold as many guns and as much ammunition as it can,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换句话说你想让犯人们全副武装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're going to arm the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.52,0:50:36.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经做好了防护措施 以保证他们只能互射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precautions will be made to make sure they can only shoot at people on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.11,0:50:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9辆车 3天 2万发子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine cars, three days, 20,000 rounds of ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.12,0:50:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从格斗到车斗 确实是一个大跨步啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going from righting to racing, that's a big leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.92,0:50:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要一个过渡 使得二者之间的衔接更加自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a hook. Something that incorporates the two better.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.34,0:50:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 在节目中 没人会在乎比赛本身 规则随便定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, in a game show, no one cares about the game. The game's arbitrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.58,0:51:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众关注的是惊险程度以及奖惩情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People care about the risk and the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.26,0:51:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直关注着比赛 而没有考虑后者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we've been concentrating on the game, not the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.73,0:51:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以观众们觉得无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why our audience is bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.69,0:51:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好好考虑下彩头如何设置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's concentrate on the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比金钱更给力的彩头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A prize more valuable than money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.28,0:51:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你觉得应该怎么办呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. What's more valuable than money?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.86,0:51:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.16,0:51:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比钱更重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a more valuable prize than money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.66,0:51:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们和政府的合约中 我们自己管判决这块儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In our deal with the state, we control sentencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.58,0:51:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换句话说他们的命在我们手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means we control their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.67,0:51:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果车手赢得五场比赛 那么他就自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if a prisoner wins five races, he gets his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.92,0:51:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是因为什么进来的 不管是抢劫 强奸 还是杀人了 随便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what he's in for, robbery, rape, homicide, whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.17,0:51:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他都会获得释放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he wins his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.63,0:51:42.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,获得重生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wins his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.76,0:51:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have life,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.18,0:51:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.44,0:51:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.48,0:51:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫"死亡飞车"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.12,0:52:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你讲 真是他娘的垃圾 罗科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? That's fucking bullshit, Rocco.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.42,0:52:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道个p 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how do you know, man? Maybe ifs for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.12,0:52:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一是真的呢 你开玩笑呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.21,0:52:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得他们会放了这些杀人犯 还有强奸犯出去吗 你们信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think they're gonna let murderers and rapists out of this place, ever'?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.85,0:52:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 卢克说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Luke's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.21,0:52:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 你丫根本就不会开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides that, homes, you don't drive worth a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.22,0:52:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个去死吧 就会那我打岔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Fucking blow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.22,0:52:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是他妈死玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking faggot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.56,0:52:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能是我唯一能出去的机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be the only chance I have of getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.85,0:52:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去之后你会做什么啊百事通?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what would you do, Lists, if you got out?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.82,0:52:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新做人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.58,0:52:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎收看《死亡飞车》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.91,0:52:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"死亡岛"监狱接下来的3天 将会举行一次"死亡飞车"大赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminal Island Penitentiary hosts three days of the ultimate in auto carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.22,0:52:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而第一场的比赛10分钟后就会上演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day one of the race begins in 10 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.34,0:52:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令人惊喜的是 我们将不会插播广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and will be brought to you without commercial interruption
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.67,0:53:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的安危是我们的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by Wayland International Your safety is our top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 好戏开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready. The show's about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.86,0:53:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要换台 精彩比赛马上开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dim the lights. The carnage is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.12,0:53:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎收看《死亡飞车》第一集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to day one of Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.91,0:53:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一共18名十恶不赦的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you, 18 cons vie for their freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.46,0:53:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想进入第二天的比赛就必须保证撑下今天的3圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must survive all three laps in order to proceed to day two.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.79,0:53:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们首先要克服的是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their first challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.75,0:53:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有9辆车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are only nine cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.42,0:53:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 各位 只有9辆车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, gentlemen. Nine cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.81,0:53:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}90;
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.17,0:54:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他妈的太爽了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.68,0:54:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9辆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.97,0:54:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况越来越令人心旷神怡了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just keeps getting better and better!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.35,0:54:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝 少说废话 多办事!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, baby. How about a bit v rodet?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.62,0:54:57.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝 就你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, baby, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.13,0:55:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少他妈臭美了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.18,0:55:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛不让他揍你一顿啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you let that con beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.72,0:55:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.40,0:55:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干嘛用的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck! Hey, why do I need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.57,0:55:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你弄下 好吧 好吧 这是谁在说话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mind helping me out with this? Yeah. Yeah. Who am I talking to'?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.39,0:55:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的智囊团呗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To talk to your pit team. Pit team?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.15,0:55:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智囊团? 卢克 听到你的声音还不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke! Good to have you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.57,0:55:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些按钮可以控制 枪 汽油弹 烟幕弹 还有凝固汽油弹...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you got your guns, your oil, your smoke, and your napalm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.25,0:55:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别老盯着我啊! 比赛开始了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your eyes on the road. Let's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.89,0:55:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,库克! 我金伯格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke! Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.76,0:55:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 墨西哥老犹太来救你小命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. The Mexican Jew's here to save your bony white ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.77,0:56:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 宝剑和盾牌到第二圈才能启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, swords and shields don't play until the second lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.90,0:56:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了那保时捷 你的车是最快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got the fastest car out there, except the Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.69,0:56:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要正面冲突 小心后面 把你们弄成肉饼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't go head to head with that Ram, or he'll have you for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.61,0:56:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.12,0:56:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来咱们的日子不好过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we're already on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.71,0:56:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝尝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.13,0:56:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爽不爽啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel me, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.30,0:56:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 吓死你了吧 就这点本事啊小伙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I got you, baby! ls that all you got, pretty boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.46,0:56:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心右面的那辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful of the one on the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.10,0:56:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.31,0:56:47.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不错啊! 太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! That's my man! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.16,0:56:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪呢?哪呢? 左边呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he? Where is he? To the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.12,0:56:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山大·格雷迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.25,0:57:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油! 正在努力!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get it going!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.01,0:57:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的! 非得弄死你不可!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking Chinese bastard! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.85,0:57:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的! 杂种!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.01,0:57:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.69,0:57:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一圈跑得不错 卢克 现在快点去激活 宝剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a great lap, Luke, but now you need to get to a sword plate, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.86,0:57:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,激活宝剑 盾牌 和死亡头颅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate swords, shields and death heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.86,0:57:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝剑 感压阀已激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword pressure plates activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.53,0:57:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盾牌感压阀 已激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield pressure plates activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.53,0:57:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去找一个宝剑感压阀 卢克 快去找一个 宝剑感压阀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta find a sword, Luke. You gotta find a sword plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.54,0:57:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有一个!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.13,0:57:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了 快去激活 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it. Go for it. Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.30,0:57:53.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝剑感压阀 已激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword pressure plate activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.38,0:57:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感想如何啊哥们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! How do you like that one, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.05,0:57:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.68,0:58:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.22,0:58:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他丫的开枪了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, jeez! Guns! Guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.64,0:58:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让子弹飞 让子弹飞一会儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat my lead, boy! Eat my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.73,0:58:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.03,0:58:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 快离他远点! 趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get out of there! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.53,0:58:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉如何啊小伙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it feel, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.07,0:58:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 该拐弯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta turn here!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.41,0:58:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就拐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.88,0:58:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.76,0:58:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天啊! 哦 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God! Oh, God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.52,0:58:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.60,0:58:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜 耶! 真他妈险啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, yeah! That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.27,0:58:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,押注赛车是在禁酒时期开始流行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stock car racing got its start during Prohibition
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.61,0:58:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛的都是些酒鬼联邦特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with moonshine runners fleeing federal agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.86,0:59:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1947年比尔·法兰西在佛罗里达的代托纳 提议举办"全国运动汽车竞赛协会"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill France Sr. conceived NASCAR in 1947 during a meeting in Daytona, Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.87,0:59:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"百事通" 我了解了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Lists." I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.46,0:59:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盾牌感压阀 已激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield pressure plates activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.93,0:59:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.67,0:59:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给来个特写 二号摄像师 往左边点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a close up on that. Camera two, move to your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.35,1:00:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去哪了? 昂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he go? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.85,1:00:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪去了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.19,1:00:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想跑 没门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't escaping me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.69,1:00:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百万美刀 是我的啦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A million dollars. It's gonna be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.19,1:00:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.03,1:00:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回放给我听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Replay that for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.16,1:00:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百万美刀 是我的啦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A million dollars. Its gonna be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.37,1:00:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.67,1:00:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.36,1:00:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你点颜色看看 觉得自己很了不起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that, bitch. Think you're special?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.65,1:00:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.74,1:01:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要! 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.24,1:01:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.77,1:01:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一圈了 卢克 马上就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One lap to go, Luke. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.44,1:01:39.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松点 宝贝 放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me, baby. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.57,1:01:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.61,1:01:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爽!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.37,1:01:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畜生! 躲开点儿! 躲开点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it! Get out of there! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.75,1:01:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真他妈受够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.58,1:01:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况? 抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.92,1:02:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,淡定 淡定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.30,1:02:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发的哪门子的疯? 我怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.73,1:02:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了! 真不错! 真厉害啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.06,1:02:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真他妈的 混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.32,1:02:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.11,1:02:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝剑感压阀 已激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword pressure plate activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that one!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.99,1:02:31.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你傻啊干嘛把后挡板丢了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just drop our fucking tombstone?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.83,1:02:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额 我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.16,1:02:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大事不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.08,1:02:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.42,1:02:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干嘛? 好好开你的车 帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you doing? Drive, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.63,1:02:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"帅哥"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Pretty boy."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.17,1:02:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的这破车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn this fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.35,1:02:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.81,1:02:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你点颜色看看 混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.68,1:02:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat that! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.44,1:03:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧 去死吧你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on! You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.38,1:03:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.48,1:03:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.28,1:03:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你死定了吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.87,1:03:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.04,1:03:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你真是我的福啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I lucked out, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.21,1:03:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.46,1:03:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我们表现得神吧 金伯格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess we put that magic to work Goldberg. Well, brave!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.80,1:03:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 卢克 漂亮!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Luke! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.21,1:03:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"死亡飞车"首战初捷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The debut of Death Race is in the books.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.97,1:03:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢卡斯 是当之无愧的黑马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas is the surprise winner
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.30,1:03:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面的排名依次是比格·比尔 卡林 阿帕奇 山德 还有14K\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}followed by Big Bill, Calin, Apache, Xander and 14K.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.52,1:03:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢卡斯能撑到最后吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can Carl Lucas hold on to win his freedom?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.73,1:03:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬请各位关注明天的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tune in tomorrow to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.24,1:03:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶! 耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.58,1:04:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 你开车还真是一流啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man! You can drive, man! What a rush, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.33,1:04:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 金伯格 你搞笑呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Goldberg, you kidding me'?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 你是从哪里学的那招啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where'd you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.76,1:04:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可当过女童军的啊真的啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a Girl Scout. Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.26,1:04:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我怎么教训你 妈的! 你没病吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you, fucker! ls that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.05,1:04:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈明天比赛的时候等着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mess with somebody in this motherfucking race!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.76,1:04:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈吓唬谁呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a fucking date? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 来啊臭小子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yaah? Come on! Fucking pretty boy! Gonna fucking blow up your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.39,1:04:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊借你两个胆 婊子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, suck my dick, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.73,1:04:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 百事通 去跟他过两招 去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Lists, go kick his ass. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.24,1:04:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.32,1:04:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的口臭死了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.13,1:04:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特里娜 该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katrina! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.63,1:04:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 我明天能再见到你吗? 看你够不够走运咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, so I get to see you tomorrow, or what? If you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.82,1:05:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.74,1:05:13.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 走吧 去小睡一会儿 哥们们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on, snap out of it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.45,1:05:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 百事通 你好好修理下它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Lists, you gotta fix it up there under here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.28,1:05:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿 还有这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here. Right in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.13,1:05:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 卢卡斯 赶紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Lucas, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.92,1:05:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听见了吗 快走 嘿 干嘛抓我啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him. Move. Hey, what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.76,1:05:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快睡觉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goto sleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.31,1:05:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 真他妈扯淡!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.20,1:05:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛拉我过来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what did I do'?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.00,1:05:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.53,1:06:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有功者当赏 有过者当罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the victor belongs the spoils.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.66,1:06:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你到底什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so what does that mean'?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.21,1:06:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.46,1:06:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在古罗马 获得胜利的角斗士将会得到恩赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ancient Rome, the winning gladiator was the recipient of gifts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.22,1:06:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当权者为了表示爱才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A show of gratitude from the powers that be
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.51,1:06:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会表示自己最大的诚意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.06,1:06:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.81,1:06:30.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想怎么她就怎么样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do with her what you please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.48,1:06:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.98,1:06:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你是哪根葱啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.74,1:06:38.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是人间的主宰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你讲 他们可能在偷看我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they're probably watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.26,1:06:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还在偷听吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listening, too, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.26,1:07:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我们当猴耍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of game they're playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.10,1:07:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额 可能在打赌咱们下面会做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, probably betting on what we'll do next.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.07,1:07:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 他们想让咱们走得更近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Option A, they're trying to get us closer
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以利用我们其中一个对付另一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they can use one of us against the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.44,1:07:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二种可能性 是让我们互相生疑 然后在比赛的时候失利?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Option B being, maybe, put a wedge between us, so we fuck up on the track?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.11,1:07:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就随他们的意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we do what they want,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.45,1:07:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随他们想怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave the bullshit for later.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.96,1:07:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在开我玩笑吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You playing me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎么样呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.09,1:07:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.95,1:08:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯恩出价一百万要卢卡斯的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kane put a million dollar bounty on Lucas,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.09,1:08:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都盯着奖金呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the bangers are going for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.79,1:08:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把卢卡斯先生单独关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put Mr. Lucas in solitary.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.71,1:09:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我觉得咱们自己可以解决 不过这事太大了 保安可能都会说漏嘴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought this was a prison thing, but this is too big for even the guards to resist.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.02,1:09:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还会让他比赛吗? 嗯 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still gonna let him race? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.72,1:09:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过想杀他必须要知道有摄像机盯着你们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're free to kill him on the track, just not off camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.35,1:09:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.90,1:09:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下 等下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.75,1:09:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 跟我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们爽过了 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had your fun. Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.59,1:09:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们这是去哪啊? 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.22,1:09:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他妈什么情况?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.19,1:10:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特里娜 这儿的视野真是开阔啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful view of freedom from here, Katrina.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.78,1:10:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.28,1:10:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你是谁呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.95,1:10:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本人还真是个可人儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're much more attractive in person.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.74,1:10:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过奖啊你想怎么样呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flattered. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.62,1:10:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢卡斯 我想要他的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas. I want him dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.13,1:10:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为回报 我给你自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in return, I offer you freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.63,1:10:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你一次重新做人的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance of life outside these walls
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.05,1:10:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成一个简单任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for one simple task.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只有48小时 你杀了他要么我杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got 48 hours. You kill him or I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请抓住这次获得自由的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me make these walls disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.78,1:10:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想象下自己在外面世界的样子 卡特里娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me make you part of the view from outside, Katrina.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.06,1:10:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.75,1:10:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,48小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.50,1:11:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tick tuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.86,1:11:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂? 65成的收视率啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Sixty Eve share.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.60,1:11:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.12,1:11:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经是最好的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's truly for the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.66,1:11:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不高兴 董事会也不高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't happy, the board wasn't happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.50,1:11:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要一个志同道合的人管理这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need someone for this institution that shares the common vision.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.04,1:11:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.38,1:11:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Park狱长 我们送你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warden Parks, we're hereto escort you from the premises.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.47,1:11:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖陷者 必自坠也\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"whosoever diggeth a pit shall fall therein."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.43,1:11:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旧约 箴言 26段27章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proverb 26:27.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.60,1:12:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那陷阱很深吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that supposed to be deep?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.44,1:12:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你掉下去的时候 很深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully deep enough that, when you fall,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.90,1:12:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候你他妈的就可以摔断脖子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll break your fucking neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.75,1:12:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎么样 该比赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want? Time to race.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.46,1:13:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈的最好小心点 Luke\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a big fucking bulls eye on your back Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.03,1:13:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得陷入重围了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel all those eyes on you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.00,1:13:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为你长得帅 也不是你得了第一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't 'cause you're pretty or because you're in first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.80,1:13:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Markus Kane出一百万美元买你的人头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Markus Kane put a million dollars on your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.63,1:13:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是他妈的一大笔钱 Lucas\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a monster fucking bounty, Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.89,1:13:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.81,1:13:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.52,1:13:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我干嘛要撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I lie?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.31,1:13:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对我来说毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes no fucking sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.44,1:13:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.50,1:13:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二 一 开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, one, and we're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.96,1:13:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎观看死亡飞车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.63,1:13:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始的18位参赛者 现在只剩下了6个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighteen men started. Only six remain.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.56,1:14:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计昨天有五千万观众见证了Lucas的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An estimated 50 million people watched Carl Lucas win day one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.44,1:14:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能再次重现夺冠的一幕吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he do it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.14,1:14:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它的参赛者可不会让他轻易取胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five other racers will have something to say about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.98,1:14:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到死亡比赛的第二个比赛日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to day two of Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.86,1:14:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关上灯 好戏即将上演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dim the lights. The carnage is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.41,1:14:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 你们今天早上爽了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Aren't you two just bubbling over with sunshine this morning?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.13,1:14:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 赢下这场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We got a race to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.55,1:14:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.05,1:14:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.72,1:14:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那开始比赛吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's race.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.57,1:14:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到你了 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you now, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.66,1:14:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.24,1:15:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.91,1:15:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 被爆菊了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! I just fucked your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.96,1:15:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把武器灯给他点亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate swords and shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.26,1:15:16.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器系统启动 操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword plate activated. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.92,1:15:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心你后面 注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your back! Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.43,1:15:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes the guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.89,1:15:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要找个防具灯 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta End a shield, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.61,1:15:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快找个防具灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta find a shield!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.27,1:15:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有一个 我看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one! I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.99,1:15:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for it. Go for ii!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.23,1:15:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防御系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield pressure plate activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.61,1:15:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放烟雾 不 太早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw the smoke! No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.16,1:15:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Luke 你在等什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke, what're you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.25,1:15:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释放它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.24,1:15:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在释放烟雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smoke, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.94,1:16:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来把车推回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this car back in the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.11,1:16:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.20,1:16:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 太爽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Great shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.33,1:16:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 宝贝 我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, baby, now we come.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.47,1:16:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword plate activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.00,1:16:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去 去 快去开枪 快去开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go! Get gun! Get gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.63,1:16:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心后面 快闪开 Luke\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your back! Get your ass out of there, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.55,1:16:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百万是我的啦 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bounty is mine, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.06,1:16:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙太讨厌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of this asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.78,1:16:50.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是让他结束的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.48,1:16:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧的神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.12,1:16:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.19,1:17:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig that!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.08,1:17:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还受得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still taking it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.09,1:17:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You die! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.59,1:18:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我要让你死在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today! Today you die!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.26,1:18:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you got, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.73,1:18:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.55,1:18:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 直接去撞线吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, ifs clear sailing to the finish line now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.22,1:18:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.81,1:18:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我敌人的敌人 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy of my enemy. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.64,1:18:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You die.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.00,1:19:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能解释下你为什么我们拼死去救那个小子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna tell me why you just risked our lives to save that banger?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.20,1:19:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是中国古惑仔 他们是Markus唯一不会雇佣的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're Triads. The only people Markus would not deal with.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.42,1:19:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是为什么他们不追杀我们 他们完全不知道怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they're not after us. They have no clue about the hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.51,1:19:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一命换一命的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's a Triad kill thing. It's a life for a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.79,1:19:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救了他的命 他就欠我一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I save his, he owes me a favour.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.58,1:19:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 那我也救了你 真的 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I saved your life. Really? How so?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.79,1:20:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你亲爱的Markus Kane用自由来诱惑我杀掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because your Markus Kane offered to buy my freedom if I would kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.49,1:20:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊他们都想干掉我 你也想吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus! They all want me dead, now you, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.88,1:20:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你也欠我一次了 我已经等不及还你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you owe me a favour, too. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.97,1:20:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想欠你的 滚开 Goldberg\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I want a favour, too, huh? Fuck off, Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.73,1:20:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.15,1:20:25.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword pressure plates activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.40,1:20:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有防具灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.49,1:20:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防御系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield pressure plate activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.94,1:20:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.16,1:20:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用我旁边那个凝固汽油弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate the napalm on my signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.45,1:20:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.41,1:20:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 失灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this? It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.79,1:20:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什么问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.50,1:20:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西坏了 中计了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not good, Luke. It's a setup.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.80,1:20:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 我来了 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm coming, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.68,1:20:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Goldberg 有人在我车上做了手脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Goldberg. Someone had a play date with this car.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.02,1:21:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在什么东西都没有 没有枪 没有烟雾 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing. No guns, no smoke, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.77,1:21:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 让我撞死你个小娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, hit it, you dumbass bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.56,1:21:03.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转弯 转弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swerve! Swerve!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.98,1:21:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 快转弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, motherfucker! Tum!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.22,1:21:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.65,1:21:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用弹射座椅吧 不 你想要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace yourself. No! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.89,1:21:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck out cf there!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.03,1:21:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 你必须要想个办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! You need to gel out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.78,1:21:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.29,1:21:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没得选抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No choice. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.55,1:21:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.47,1:21:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个B一直打个不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker won't stop tiring!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.18,1:21:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红外线导弹就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat seeking missile has been activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.06,1:21:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快躲开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Hey! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.24,1:21:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.10,1:22:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 我操 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Shit! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.40,1:22:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的怎么了 你毁了你的后勤小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck? You just killed your own pit crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.65,1:22:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子 闭上你的臭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch, you shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.17,1:22:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 快离开那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goldberg. Hey, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.55,1:23:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往车里拍 我想要一个特写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in that car! I want a close up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.06,1:23:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.89,1:23:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.74,1:23:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.04,1:23:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.17,1:23:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.76,1:23:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Goldberg 快救他出来 快救他出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goldberg, get him out! Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.36,1:24:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.40,1:24:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安息吧 Luke\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest in peace, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.24,1:24:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要为Luke的死负责 你他妈的在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta answer for Luke. What the fuck you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.37,1:24:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Katrina 说车子里面动了手脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katrina said ii was rigged from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.45,1:24:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你他妈是唯一一个可以进到车里的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're the only motherfucker that could have got to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.08,1:24:51.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你杀了他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed him?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.17,1:24:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我远点 你们两个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getaway from me. Fuck you both.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.47,1:25:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟他谈谈 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to talk to him. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.89,1:25:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved your life!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.19,1:25:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欠他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.19,1:25:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一命换一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A life for a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.52,1:25:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道该做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.58,1:25:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在昏迷中 但幸运的是他的脉搏已经稳定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've induced coma. Thankfully all his vitals have stabilised
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.29,1:25:35.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他需要得到更好的治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he should be moved to a facility more suited to his needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.38,1:25:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.50,1:25:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生 外面有人想杀掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor someone from the outside tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.22,1:25:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非他们认为他死了才能回去交差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless they think he's dead, they'll come back to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.43,1:25:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 但我不能让他"被死亡"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I can't pronounce a man dead while he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.60,1:25:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.53,1:26:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么样才能找个人来代替Parks\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we doing with finding a replacement for Parks?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.24,1:26:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是从哈里伯顿（财富五百强）那边介绍过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She comes highly recommended from Halliburton.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.41,1:26:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有顶级的拘留所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ran their maximum security detention centre.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.08,1:26:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很强很聪明 而且精力无限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's strong. She's smart. Ruthlessly ambitious.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.08,1:26:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想如果没有我不在场的话 她会跟人们说死亡赛车是她的点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think if I weren't around, she'd tell people that Death Race was her idea
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.75,1:26:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且她也肯定能说服人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she'd convince them that it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.88,1:26:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网络上的交接做好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the switchover to the Internet?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.67,1:26:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经做好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transitions complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.50,1:26:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们明天就开始全球直播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We start streaming live worldwide tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.84,1:26:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赚的已经超过了付费电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The numbers have already surpassed pay per view,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.43,1:26:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这得感谢Frankenstein的广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanks to the Frankenstein commercial.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.93,1:26:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.26,1:26:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想你所说的frankenstein\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been meaning to talk to you about this Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.52,1:26:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给他化妆了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you make him up?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.11,1:26:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Frankenstein是存在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein most certainly exists,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.07,1:26:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他明天将会出现在赛场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he will be in the race tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.91,1:26:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He better be.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.28,1:26:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他最好和广告上说的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he better come as good as advertised.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.96,1:27:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手术的过程很惊险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The procedure's experimental and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.72,1:27:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们讨论过把电极插入了他的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about placing electrodes into the brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.30,1:27:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我他是最好的人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me he was a perfect candidate.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.89,1:27:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 他当然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.10,1:27:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不敢保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there are no guarantees.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.31,1:27:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄醒他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.82,1:27:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lucas 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mn Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.99,1:27:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚经历二级烧伤 你全身有85%的地方都烧掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got second degree burns over 85% of your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.46,1:27:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 你很幸运地活了先来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're lucky that you suffered no significant injuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.67,1:27:42.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骨头和器官都完好如初...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a broken bone or damaged organ,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.50,1:27:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...考虑到你经历了如此严重的烧伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is remarkable considering the intensity of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.14,1:27:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这是地狱咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.69,1:27:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.02,1:28:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了地狱 你还能在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where else would you be?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.19,1:28:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.99,1:28:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢五场你就自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win five races and you're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.07,1:28:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯你妈的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of your fucking mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.08,1:28:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也没有Markus Kane了 激发你的本能吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more Markus Kane trying to track you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.54,1:28:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就像是重生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.54,1:28:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.25,1:28:25.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 你看看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.72,1:28:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这算是什么重生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of second chance would I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.76,1:28:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不当Frankenstein的话 你就什么都不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're either Frankenstein or you're nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.23,1:28:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能再成为Carl Lucas了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're certainly not Carl Lucas any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.19,1:28:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界都见证了他的火化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire world watched him incinerate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.40,1:28:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是你的死亡证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's even a death certificate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.11,1:28:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可怜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pity you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.11,1:28:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 就算你不为自己想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay If you don't do it for your life,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.74,1:28:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要为Katrina想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you do it for Katrina.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.08,1:29:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让五个猥琐男去跟Katrina约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll furlough five of my worst sodomites for a play date with sweet Katrina.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.75,1:29:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想想她到时候还能活吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time they're finished with hen she'll be lucky if she has a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.39,1:30:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样 Lucas先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you feel, Mr. Lucas?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.03,1:30:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry 10 disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.07,1:30:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要和我这个墨西哥犹太人呆在一起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to settle for the Mexican Jew,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.61,1:31:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三 二 一 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one, and were in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.62,1:31:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位观众 晚上好 欢迎收看 死亡赛车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, and welcome to Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.79,1:31:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为来自全球的两千万观众直播这场赛事 而这周...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're streaming live worldwide for over 20 million viewers. This week...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.21,1:31:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号灯变绿的时候 马上切换到赛车手的宣传片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut in promos of the drivers as soon as the light hits green,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.21,1:31:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后切回到我 抬起镜头 再一直跟着Frankenstein 明白了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cut back to me, crane up, chase out after Frankenstein, Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.05,1:31:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩 这看起来不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It'll look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.30,1:31:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我知道这很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know it's a great shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.89,1:31:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 倒数五个数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will be. Wen live in five.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.80,1:31:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, time for one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.72,1:31:23.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜头拉远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.93,1:31:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.27,1:31:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lists在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Lists?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.23,1:31:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说他有点事情要处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he had some business to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.52,1:32:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.64,1:32:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.27,1:32:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本来以为是哥帅哥吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expecting another pretty boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.51,1:33:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众朋友们 晚上好 欢迎收看 死亡赛车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, and welcome to Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.97,1:33:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在为全球两千万观众直播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're streaming live to over 20 million viewers.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.39,1:33:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这周 14k试图再次夺冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This week, 14K attempts to repeat as champion.
